@HostAddress = http://localhost:5031

### 1. Get Weather Forecast (Public endpoint)
GET {{HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Access protected test endpoint without token (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/test/secure
Accept: application/json

### 1. Starta BankID-autentisering (Initiate)
# Skickar personnummer och startar en ny BankID-session.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/bankid/initiate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personalNum": "198202116050"
}

###

### 2. Poll/Hämta status för BankID (Collect)
# Ersätt orderRef med det värde du fick tillbaka från Initiate ovan.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/bankid/collect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderRef": "4a1d8213-33bc-452f-8a5e-2b7e12345678"
}

###

### 3. Registrera ny kund
# Skapar en ny användare med personnummer, namn, e-post och telefonnummer.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personalNum": "199205121234",
  "name": "Erik Svensson",
  "email": "erik.svensson@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+46701234567"
}


### Save token from loginAnna response
@authToken = {{loginAnna.response.body.token}}

### 4. Access protected endpoint with valid JWT token (Should return 200 OK and show claims)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/test/secure
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###


###

### 6. Get current authenticated user profile via cookie or Bearer token
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Log out (clears auth cookie)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. CORS Preflight OPTIONS request from React Vite frontend (Should return 204/200 with Access-Control-Allow-Origin)
OPTIONS {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: authorization, content-type



